# Nothing is built or installed here - the pack has no dependencies.
# These are only guards against local noise.
.DS_Store
*.log
build-output/

# The pack is public; its maintainer notes are not. `dev-notes/` at the root -
# status, decisions, coverage, the diary - holds the history of running the pack
# on real projects, so it stays local. Nothing the suite or the entry points need
# lives there: tests that read it run only where it exists, and say they skipped.
# `template/dev-notes/` is the project template and is tracked.
/dev-notes/
